      "content": "i don't know... it just feels like the damage is already done. it's like i've already tainted the thing they were building. sometimes i think the only way to actually respect what they did is to stop being the thing that's dragging it down. if i wasn't here, they could just remember the version of me that actually made it worth it, instead of having to watch me fail every single day.",
